<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Telecel hits all-time high.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Telecel hits all-time high.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Portuguese mobile phone operator Telecel hit an all-time high of 11,500 escudos, a rise of 45 percent since the stock was floated on Lisbon bourse on December 10, dealers said.  </p>
<p>&quot;Good prospects for the Lisbon bourse, the superior returns of the bourse compared to the bond market and the resumption of buying by foreign investors are pushing up Telecel's share price,&quot; said a dealer.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
